  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the Server**\n\nOkay, I\'m now actively constructing the Express backend in `server.ts` according to the full-stack server architecture. So far, the focus is on the essential configurations; port 3000 on host `0.0.0.0` is set. Currently, I\'m working to implement the health check endpoint `/api/health`.\n\n\n**Defining the AI Endpoints**\n\nNow, I\'m setting up the core AI-driven endpoints. I\'m focusing on the `/api/analyze-plant` route, which will be the gateway to the Gemini AI. The endpoint will handle image base64 or photo identifiers, then interface with the `@google/genai` library, extracting crucial parameters like plant height, canopy coverage, growth, disease detection, fruit ripeness and crop yield.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
