  planner_response {
    response: "I have built and configured the **AgriTwin Digital Twin Application & Web System**, designed specifically for your college group project and client demonstration needs.\n\n### Key Capabilities & System Features\n\n- **6 Core Blueprint Parameters**:\n  - **Plant Height Detection**: Measures vertical stem size and internode elongation in real time (cm).\n  - **Canopy Coverage Detection**: Determines ground foliage percentage and leaf area index (%).\n  - **Growth Detection**: Tracks biometric growth rate and crop stage progression across a 90-day season (+cm/day).\n  - **Disease Detection**: Identifies pathogen health risks, chlorosis, and leaf spot vulnerabilities with actionable organic treatment recommendations.\n  - **Fruit Ripeness Detection**: Evaluates crop maturity ratio and spectral color stage (unripe green $\\rightarrow$ harvest ripe).\n  - **Crop Yield Estimation**: Predicts overall harvest volume ($\\text{kg/m}^2$) based on digital twin telemetry.\n\n- **Interactive Digital Twin Canvas**:\n  - Visual 2D/3D field rendering stage with animated plant stems, leaf canopy overlays, fruit ripeness markers, and real-time health meters.\n  - Live climate control sliders (air temperature, relative humidity, soil moisture) to run \"what-if\" drought or irrigation stress simulations.\n\n- **Server-Side Gemini AI Plant Scanner**:\n  - Upload or select field photographs to run server-side vision AI, extracting all 6 digital twin parameters simultaneously and syncing them into the live model.\n\n- **Implementation Architecture Blueprint**:\n  - Detailed 5-layer technical breakdown (Hardware IoT Edge $\\rightarrow$ Telemetry Mesh $\\rightarrow$ Gemini AI Vision Pipeline $\\rightarrow$ Digital Twin State Machine $\\rightarrow$ Web App & API) explaining the physical-to-digital connection for faculty evaluators and clients.\n\n- **Google Slides Presentation Deck Export**:\n  - Integrated directly with Google Slides API to generate an 8-slide presentation deck with customizable project titles, student developer roles, college details, and client outcomes."
    thinking: "**Confirming Initial Success**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the initial build and compilation were successful, free of errors! Now, I\'m shifting focus to ensuring my summary adheres precisely to the specified communication guidelines \342\200\223 maintaining a conversational, professional, and objective tone, just as requested.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built and configured the **AgriTwin Digital Twin Application & Web System**, designed specifically for your college group project and client demonstration needs.\n\n### Key Capabilities & System Features\n\n- **6 Core Blueprint Parameters**:\n  - **Plant Height Detection**: Measures vertical stem size and internode elongation in real time (cm).\n  - **Canopy Coverage Detection**: Determines ground foliage percentage and leaf area index (%).\n  - **Growth Detection**: Tracks biometric growth rate and crop stage progression across a 90-day season (+cm/day).\n  - **Disease Detection**: Identifies pathogen health risks, chlorosis, and leaf spot vulnerabilities with actionable organic treatment recommendations.\n  - **Fruit Ripeness Detection**: Evaluates crop maturity ratio and spectral color stage (unripe green $\\rightarrow$ harvest ripe).\n  - **Crop Yield Estimation**: Predicts overall harvest volume ($\\text{kg/m}^2$) based on digital twin telemetry.\n\n- **Interactive Digital Twin Canvas**:\n  - Visual 2D/3D field rendering stage with animated plant stems, leaf canopy overlays, fruit ripeness markers, and real-time health meters.\n  - Live climate control sliders (air temperature, relative humidity, soil moisture) to run \"what-if\" drought or irrigation stress simulations.\n\n- **Server-Side Gemini AI Plant Scanner**:\n  - Upload or select field photographs to run server-side vision AI, extracting all 6 digital twin parameters simultaneously and syncing them into the live model.\n\n- **Implementation Architecture Blueprint**:\n  - Detailed 5-layer technical breakdown (Hardware IoT Edge $\\rightarrow$ Telemetry Mesh $\\rightarrow$ Gemini AI Vision Pipeline $\\rightarrow$ Digital Twin State Machine $\\rightarrow$ Web App & API) explaining the physical-to-digital connection for faculty evaluators and clients.\n\n- **Google Slides Presentation Deck Export**:\n  - Integrated directly with Google Slides API to generate an 8-slide presentation deck with customizable project titles, student developer roles, college details, and client outcomes."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 35726347
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
