  user_input {
    user_response: "Agricultural Digital Twin Application \342\200\223 Wireframe Design Prompt\nDesign a modern, professional web application wireframe for an AI-powered Agricultural Digital Twin platform. The system creates a virtual representation of crops by combining IoT sensor data, computer vision analysis, and machine learning predictions.\n\nTarget Users\nFarmers\nAgricultural Researchers\nFarm Managers\nAgricultural Institutions\nApplication Structure\n1. Login Screen\nApplication logo\nEmail and Password fields\nLogin button\nForgot Password option\nClean agriculture-themed design\n2. Main Dashboard\nDisplay real-time farm overview with KPI cards:\n\nTotal Plants Monitored\nAverage Plant Height\nCanopy Coverage %\nDisease Risk Level\nPredicted Yield\nTemperature, Humidity, Soil Moisture\nInclude:\n\nLive sensor data panel\nRecent alerts panel\nFarm status summary\nNavigation sidebar\n3. Digital Twin Screen\nCreate a dedicated page showing:\n\nVirtual plant/crop representation\nPlant ID selection dropdown\nCurrent plant status\nHistorical data timeline\nPredicted future growth\nEnvironmental conditions\nShow:\n\nPlant Height\nGrowth Rate\nCanopy Coverage\nFruit Count\nRipeness Percentage\nDisease Status\nYield Prediction\n4. Disease Detection Module\nFeatures:\n\nUpload plant image\nCamera capture option\nDisease analysis results\nConfidence score\nDisease severity indicator\nRecommended actions section\n5. Growth Analytics Module\nDisplay:\n\nPlant height trends\nGrowth rate chart\nCanopy growth chart\nHistorical comparison\nWeekly and monthly reports\n6. Fruit Ripeness Analysis\nShow:\n\nFruit count\nRipeness categories\nRipeness percentage chart\nHarvest readiness indicator\n7. Yield Prediction Module\nDisplay:\n\nPredicted crop yield\nYield trend graph\nInfluencing factors\nHarvest estimation date\n8. Sensor Monitoring Page\nReal-time IoT data:\n\nTemperature\nHumidity\nSoil Moisture\nLight Intensity\nSensor health status\n9. Alerts & Notifications\nShow:\n\nDisease alerts\nAbnormal growth alerts\nLow soil moisture alerts\nCritical environmental alerts\nDesign Requirements\nModern dashboard style\nResponsive web application\nAgriculture-themed UI\nSidebar navigation\nKPI cards\nInteractive charts and graphs\nProfessional enterprise-level appearance\nSuitable for a hackathon, final year project, or research prototype\nGoal\nThe wireframe should clearly demonstrate how a Digital Twin continuously mirrors the physical crop using IoT sensors, AI-based disease detection, growth monitoring, ripeness analysis, and yield prediction."
    items {
      text: "Agricultural Digital Twin Application \342\200\223 Wireframe Design Prompt\nDesign a modern, professional web application wireframe for an AI-powered Agricultural Digital Twin platform. The system creates a virtual representation of crops by combining IoT sensor data, computer vision analysis, and machine learning predictions.\n\nTarget Users\nFarmers\nAgricultural Researchers\nFarm Managers\nAgricultural Institutions\nApplication Structure\n1. Login Screen\nApplication logo\nEmail and Password fields\nLogin button\nForgot Password option\nClean agriculture-themed design\n2. Main Dashboard\nDisplay real-time farm overview with KPI cards:\n\nTotal Plants Monitored\nAverage Plant Height\nCanopy Coverage %\nDisease Risk Level\nPredicted Yield\nTemperature, Humidity, Soil Moisture\nInclude:\n\nLive sensor data panel\nRecent alerts panel\nFarm status summary\nNavigation sidebar\n3. Digital Twin Screen\nCreate a dedicated page showing:\n\nVirtual plant/crop representation\nPlant ID selection dropdown\nCurrent plant status\nHistorical data timeline\nPredicted future growth\nEnvironmental conditions\nShow:\n\nPlant Height\nGrowth Rate\nCanopy Coverage\nFruit Count\nRipeness Percentage\nDisease Status\nYield Prediction\n4. Disease Detection Module\nFeatures:\n\nUpload plant image\nCamera capture option\nDisease analysis results\nConfidence score\nDisease severity indicator\nRecommended actions section\n5. Growth Analytics Module\nDisplay:\n\nPlant height trends\nGrowth rate chart\nCanopy growth chart\nHistorical comparison\nWeekly and monthly reports\n6. Fruit Ripeness Analysis\nShow:\n\nFruit count\nRipeness categories\nRipeness percentage chart\nHarvest readiness indicator\n7. Yield Prediction Module\nDisplay:\n\nPredicted crop yield\nYield trend graph\nInfluencing factors\nHarvest estimation date\n8. Sensor Monitoring Page\nReal-time IoT data:\n\nTemperature\nHumidity\nSoil Moisture\nLight Intensity\nSensor health status\n9. Alerts & Notifications\nShow:\n\nDisease alerts\nAbnormal growth alerts\nLow soil moisture alerts\nCritical environmental alerts\nDesign Requirements\nModern dashboard style\nResponsive web application\nAgriculture-themed UI\nSidebar navigation\nKPI cards\nInteractive charts and graphs\nProfessional enterprise-level appearance\nSuitable for a hackathon, final year project, or research prototype\nGoal\nThe wireframe should clearly demonstrate how a Digital Twin continuously mirrors the physical crop using IoT sensors, AI-based disease detection, growth monitoring, ripeness analysis, and yield prediction."
    }
  }
}
