  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully built out the Agricultural Digital Twin wireframe application, transitioning the user interface into a clean, professional, enterprise-grade dashboard architecture. \n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Authentication Gateway**: Created a dedicated `LoginScreen` module integrating Firebase Authentication (Email/Password forms and Google Sign-In button) with a clean, agriculture-themed layout and a central Leaf logo.\n- **Application Shell & Sidebar Navigation**: Implemented a responsive `Layout` component that utilizes an expandable sidebar navigation system. It routes users seamlessly across all 8 feature modules, handling view state logic efficiently without disruptive full-page reloads.\n- **Main Dashboard**: Developed a high-level overview featuring primary KPI cards (Total Plants, Average Height, Canopy Coverage, Yield) paired with a live 3-point sensor panel and a recent alerts activity feed.\n- **Virtual Plant Rendering**: Refined the `DigitalTwinCanvas` away from the previous brutalist design, shifting to a softer, modern layout utilizing emerald and slate colors, rounded borders, and subtle shadow overlays.\n- **Growth & Analytics Modules**: Engineered responsive interactive charting modules (`GrowthAnalytics`, `FruitRipeness`, `YieldPrediction`) powered by `recharts`. Features include line graphs mapping growth acceleration against baseline norms, and pie charts evaluating readiness indicators.\n- **IoT & Alerts Control Room**: Built the `SensorMonitoring` module to track simulated 24-hour environmental trend graphs alongside hardware MCU uptime/health monitors, paired with an `AlertsNotifications` priority feed."
    modified_response: "I have successfully built out the Agricultural Digital Twin wireframe application, transitioning the user interface into a clean, professional, enterprise-grade dashboard architecture. \n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Authentication Gateway**: Created a dedicated `LoginScreen` module integrating Firebase Authentication (Email/Password forms and Google Sign-In button) with a clean, agriculture-themed layout and a central Leaf logo.\n- **Application Shell & Sidebar Navigation**: Implemented a responsive `Layout` component that utilizes an expandable sidebar navigation system. It routes users seamlessly across all 8 feature modules, handling view state logic efficiently without disruptive full-page reloads.\n- **Main Dashboard**: Developed a high-level overview featuring primary KPI cards (Total Plants, Average Height, Canopy Coverage, Yield) paired with a live 3-point sensor panel and a recent alerts activity feed.\n- **Virtual Plant Rendering**: Refined the `DigitalTwinCanvas` away from the previous brutalist design, shifting to a softer, modern layout utilizing emerald and slate colors, rounded borders, and subtle shadow overlays.\n- **Growth & Analytics Modules**: Engineered responsive interactive charting modules (`GrowthAnalytics`, `FruitRipeness`, `YieldPrediction`) powered by `recharts`. Features include line graphs mapping growth acceleration against baseline norms, and pie charts evaluating readiness indicators.\n- **IoT & Alerts Control Room**: Built the `SensorMonitoring` module to track simulated 24-hour environmental trend graphs alongside hardware MCU uptime/health monitors, paired with an `AlertsNotifications` priority feed."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
