    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Use the Google Search grounding capability to fetch local weather forecasts based on the crop\'s GPS location and display them in the MainDashboard. Design and develop a modern enterprise-grade Agricultural Digital Twin Platform for smart farming operations.\n\nThe platform should create a real-time digital replica of a farm using IoT sensors, AI analytics, computer vision, weather intelligence, and automation.\n\nThe design should be futuristic, clean, responsive, and suitable for large-scale agricultural operations.\n\nCore Modules\n1. Smart Dashboard\n\nDisplay:\n\nFarm Health Score\nYield Forecast\nActive Alerts\nWeather Conditions\nWater Consumption\nEnergy Consumption\nCarbon Footprint\nCrop Health Index\nDisease Risk Score\n\nInclude:\n\nKPI cards\nLive sensor widgets\nInteractive charts\nHeat maps\nAI-generated farm summary\n2. Interactive 3D Digital Twin\n\nCreate a virtual representation of the farm.\n\nFeatures:\n\nPlot visualization\nCrop visualization\nSensor placement\nReal-time updates\nPlant health color coding\n\nGreen = Healthy\n\nYellow = Moderate\n\nRed = Critical\n\nClicking a plot should open detailed insights.\n\n3. AI Crop Advisor\n\nAI should provide:\n\nFertilizer recommendations\nIrrigation recommendations\nPest management suggestions\nDisease treatment guidance\nHarvest timing recommendations\n\nInclude:\n\nChatGPT-style assistant\nVoice interaction\nMulti-language support\n4. Advanced Sensor Monitoring\n\nMonitor:\n\nAir Temperature\nSoil Temperature\nHumidity\nSoil Moisture\nSoil pH\nSoil EC\nNitrogen\nPhosphorus\nPotassium\nCO\342\202\202 Levels\nRainfall\nWind Speed\n\nFeatures:\n\nReal-time updates\nThreshold alerts\nHistorical trends\nSensor health monitoring\nUnique Features (These Will Impress The Client)\n5. AI Disease Detection\n\nFarmer uploads a crop image.\n\nAI detects:\n\nDisease name\nSeverity\nConfidence score\nTreatment recommendation\n\nShow:\n\nOriginal image\nHighlighted infected region\nSuggested action\n6. Plant Growth Tracking\n\nUsing weekly camera images:\n\nDisplay:\n\nPlant Height\nGrowth Rate\nGrowth Prediction\nGrowth Comparison\n\nShow animated growth timeline.\n\n7. Fruit Ripeness Detection\n\nComputer vision should determine:\n\nUnripe\nSemi-Ripe\nRipe\n\nGenerate harvest recommendations.\n\n8. Yield Prediction Engine\n\nPredict:\n\nExpected yield\nHarvest date\nRevenue estimate\n\nBased on:\n\nHistorical data\nWeather\nSensor data\nCrop type\n9. AI Farm Copilot (NEW)\n\nAn intelligent assistant that answers:\n\n\"Why is my crop health dropping?\"\n\n\"When should I irrigate?\"\n\n\"What caused the nitrogen deficiency?\"\n\n\"Predict next week\'s yield.\"\n\nThe system should explain answers using farm data.\n\n10. Smart Irrigation Automation\n\nAutomatically:\n\nStart irrigation\nStop irrigation\nRecommend water schedules\n\nBased on:\n\nSoil moisture\nWeather forecast\nCrop stage\n\nInclude manual override.\n\n11. Weather Intelligence Center\n\nFeatures:\n\n7-day forecast\nRain prediction\nHeatwave warnings\nFrost alerts\nWind alerts\n\nAI-generated recommendations.\n\n12. Drone Monitoring Module\n\nUpload drone imagery.\n\nGenerate:\n\nNDVI Maps\nCrop Stress Maps\nWater Stress Detection\nDisease Zones\nYield Maps\n13. Sustainability Dashboard\n\nTrack:\n\nWater saved\nFertilizer saved\nCarbon emissions\nEnergy consumption\n\nGenerate sustainability reports.\n\n14. Predictive Maintenance\n\nMonitor:\n\nSensor battery\nCamera health\nDevice connectivity\n\nPredict failures before they occur.\n\n15. Farm Marketplace Integration\n\nRecommend:\n\nFertilizers\nSeeds\nPesticides\n\nBased on detected deficiencies.\n\n16. Digital Farm Journal\n\nAutomatically log:\n\nIrrigation events\nFertilizer applications\nWeather events\nDisease outbreaks\nHarvest records\n\nGenerate downloadable PDF reports.\n\nTechnical Stack\n\nFrontend:\n\nReact.js\nTypeScript\nTailwind CSS\nFramer Motion\nRecharts\nLeaflet Maps\n\nBackend:\n\nFastAPI / Node.js\n\nDatabase:\n\nPostgreSQL\nMongoDB\n\nAI:\n\nOpenAI GPT\nTensorFlow\nYOLOv8\nOpenCV\n\nCloud:\n\nFirebase\nAWS S3\nPremium Feature\n\nCreate a Digital Twin Simulation Engine where users can simulate:\n\n\"What happens if irrigation is reduced by 20%?\"\n\n\"What happens if nitrogen increases by 15%?\"\n\n\"What will be the yield if rainfall drops next month?\"\n\nThe system should predict outcomes before actual deployment."
    items {
      text: "Use the Google Search grounding capability to fetch local weather forecasts based on the crop\'s GPS location and display them in the MainDashboard. Design and develop a modern enterprise-grade Agricultural Digital Twin Platform for smart farming operations.\n\nThe platform should create a real-time digital replica of a farm using IoT sensors, AI analytics, computer vision, weather intelligence, and automation.\n\nThe design should be futuristic, clean, responsive, and suitable for large-scale agricultural operations.\n\nCore Modules\n1. Smart Dashboard\n\nDisplay:\n\nFarm Health Score\nYield Forecast\nActive Alerts\nWeather Conditions\nWater Consumption\nEnergy Consumption\nCarbon Footprint\nCrop Health Index\nDisease Risk Score\n\nInclude:\n\nKPI cards\nLive sensor widgets\nInteractive charts\nHeat maps\nAI-generated farm summary\n2. Interactive 3D Digital Twin\n\nCreate a virtual representation of the farm.\n\nFeatures:\n\nPlot visualization\nCrop visualization\nSensor placement\nReal-time updates\nPlant health color coding\n\nGreen = Healthy\n\nYellow = Moderate\n\nRed = Critical\n\nClicking a plot should open detailed insights.\n\n3. AI Crop Advisor\n\nAI should provide:\n\nFertilizer recommendations\nIrrigation recommendations\nPest management suggestions\nDisease treatment guidance\nHarvest timing recommendations\n\nInclude:\n\nChatGPT-style assistant\nVoice interaction\nMulti-language support\n4. Advanced Sensor Monitoring\n\nMonitor:\n\nAir Temperature\nSoil Temperature\nHumidity\nSoil Moisture\nSoil pH\nSoil EC\nNitrogen\nPhosphorus\nPotassium\nCO\342\202\202 Levels\nRainfall\nWind Speed\n\nFeatures:\n\nReal-time updates\nThreshold alerts\nHistorical trends\nSensor health monitoring\nUnique Features (These Will Impress The Client)\n5. AI Disease Detection\n\nFarmer uploads a crop image.\n\nAI detects:\n\nDisease name\nSeverity\nConfidence score\nTreatment recommendation\n\nShow:\n\nOriginal image\nHighlighted infected region\nSuggested action\n6. Plant Growth Tracking\n\nUsing weekly camera images:\n\nDisplay:\n\nPlant Height\nGrowth Rate\nGrowth Prediction\nGrowth Comparison\n\nShow animated growth timeline.\n\n7. Fruit Ripeness Detection\n\nComputer vision should determine:\n\nUnripe\nSemi-Ripe\nRipe\n\nGenerate harvest recommendations.\n\n8. Yield Prediction Engine\n\nPredict:\n\nExpected yield\nHarvest date\nRevenue estimate\n\nBased on:\n\nHistorical data\nWeather\nSensor data\nCrop type\n9. AI Farm Copilot (NEW)\n\nAn intelligent assistant that answers:\n\n\"Why is my crop health dropping?\"\n\n\"When should I irrigate?\"\n\n\"What caused the nitrogen deficiency?\"\n\n\"Predict next week\'s yield.\"\n\nThe system should explain answers using farm data.\n\n10. Smart Irrigation Automation\n\nAutomatically:\n\nStart irrigation\nStop irrigation\nRecommend water schedules\n\nBased on:\n\nSoil moisture\nWeather forecast\nCrop stage\n\nInclude manual override.\n\n11. Weather Intelligence Center\n\nFeatures:\n\n7-day forecast\nRain prediction\nHeatwave warnings\nFrost alerts\nWind alerts\n\nAI-generated recommendations.\n\n12. Drone Monitoring Module\n\nUpload drone imagery.\n\nGenerate:\n\nNDVI Maps\nCrop Stress Maps\nWater Stress Detection\nDisease Zones\nYield Maps\n13. Sustainability Dashboard\n\nTrack:\n\nWater saved\nFertilizer saved\nCarbon emissions\nEnergy consumption\n\nGenerate sustainability reports.\n\n14. Predictive Maintenance\n\nMonitor:\n\nSensor battery\nCamera health\nDevice connectivity\n\nPredict failures before they occur.\n\n15. Farm Marketplace Integration\n\nRecommend:\n\nFertilizers\nSeeds\nPesticides\n\nBased on detected deficiencies.\n\n16. Digital Farm Journal\n\nAutomatically log:\n\nIrrigation events\nFertilizer applications\nWeather events\nDisease outbreaks\nHarvest records\n\nGenerate downloadable PDF reports.\n\nTechnical Stack\n\nFrontend:\n\nReact.js\nTypeScript\nTailwind CSS\nFramer Motion\nRecharts\nLeaflet Maps\n\nBackend:\n\nFastAPI / Node.js\n\nDatabase:\n\nPostgreSQL\nMongoDB\n\nAI:\n\nOpenAI GPT\nTensorFlow\nYOLOv8\nOpenCV\n\nCloud:\n\nFirebase\nAWS S3\nPremium Feature\n\nCreate a Digital Twin Simulation Engine where users can simulate:\n\n\"What happens if irrigation is reduced by 20%?\"\n\n\"What happens if nitrogen increases by 15%?\"\n\n\"What will be the yield if rainfall drops next month?\"\n\nThe system should predict outcomes before actual deployment."
    }
