  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating Weather Data**\n\nI\'m working on integrating local weather forecasts, sourced via Google Search, directly into the MainDashboard. The system will leverage the crop\'s GPS data for accurate weather information. In addition, I have a large prompt outlining 16 modules, and 1 has already been implemented.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Weather Data**\n\nI\'ve shifted focus to integrating local weather forecasts. The user wants me to use Google Search to fetch this data, grounded by the crop\'s GPS location, which is a key requirement. I think I\'ll use Gemini API\'s Search Grounding to accomplish this since it gives me the Google Search tool. The initial plan includes displaying the forecast in the MainDashboard as per the user\'s explicit request. I\'m focusing on that, instead of the large prompt about a whole application.\n\n\n"
