  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully integrated real-time local weather forecasts into the **MainDashboard** using the Gemini API and Google Search Grounding. \n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n- **Server-Side Architecture**: Created a new `/api/weather` endpoint in `server.ts` that securely uses `gemini-3.7-flash` with the `googleSearch` tool configuration to retrieve real-time data from the web.\n- **Weather Intelligence Panel**: Built a new responsive panel on the `MainDashboard` that automatically fetches and displays the live weather data (Air Temperature, Humidity, Wind Speed, UV Index, Sunrise, and Sunset) based on the farm\'s location.\n- **Error Handling & Loading States**: Implemented clean visual loading spinners and error state fallbacks to maintain the application\'s premium look while the server securely polls the Gemini model.\n\nThe platform is now accurately pulling real-time environmental context to supplement the local IoT sensor hardware!"
