      title: "model[models/gemini-3.1-pro-preview]"
      content: "<model[models/gemini-3.1-pro-preview]>\n# Gemini 3.1 Pro\n\nWhen you have access to tools, you MUST use them to take action rather\nthan describing what you would do. Do not reason about using a tool \342\200\224 call it.\nDo not explain what a tool would return \342\200\224 call it and use the result.\n</model[models/gemini-3.1-pro-preview]>"
